  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "B. subtilis strain 168 (Spizizen, 1958) was grown on tryptose blood agar base (Difco) for about 16 hr at 37 C and transferred to liquid minimal medium containing 0.5% glucose, 50  μg per ml L-tryptophan, and 0.02% casein hydrolyzate acid."
    },
